  "goodToKnow": "Der Rechtsweg is recourse to the courts: den Rechtsweg beschreiten or einschlagen (to take legal action). Article 19(4) of the Grundgesetz guarantees it to anyone whose rights are violated by public authority. Almost every German prize draw ends with Der Rechtsweg ist ausgeschlossen, meaning you can't sue over the result. Plural: die Rechtswege."
